  "readmeFile": "docs/readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.19 - Pin Serilog.AspNetCore dependency to 9.0.x for .NET 8 consumers.\n1.0.18 - Added Log Viewer middleware for host ASP.NET Core projects, including appsettings-based system log directory setup, multi-file selection, date range filtering, live refresh, and stack trace preservation.\n1.0.12 - Added LINE raw message push/reply support and multi-bot helpers for gateway integrations; updated MailKit and MimeKit dependencies to 4.16.0.\n1.0.11 - Added SystemMonitor and MonitorCollector package metadata.\n1.0.6 - Upgrade all NuGet dependencies to latest stable versions compatible with .NET 8: Azure.Identity 1.19.0, Serilog 4.3.1, Serilog.AspNetCore 9.0.0, Serilog.Sinks.Console 6.1.1, Serilog.Sinks.File 7.0.0, Serilog.Sinks.MSSqlServer 9.0.3, Microsoft.Data.SqlClient 7.0.0, Microsoft.Data.Sqlite 10.0.5, System.Text.Json 10.0.5.\n1.0.5 - Internal maintenance (pack script automation).\n1.0.4 - Enhanced MailService: multi-recipient (To/Cc/Bcc) parsing, Serilog Debug integration, attachment logging, improved error messages (includes InnerException), safe recipient override in DEBUG build.\n1.0.0 - Initial release.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
